Z||000000||maffthekat||04-20-2001||08:57 AM||||Hi y'all,<BR>I bought a '84 notch back a few months ago and whilst giving it a good jet wash I noticed that the bit of trim on the front right fender between the wheel arch and the door was made of wood! Were all 84 Feiros made out of wood?! <BR>Seriously, I would like to replace this bit with a proper geniune GM one, I've tried the Fiero store etc, but GM are stopping the manufacture of them over the next months and there aren't any available anywhere.<BR>Have any of you fellow Fierofiles got any spares? I would pay a decent amount for it...<P>All I want to do is make my Fiero look perty!!<P>Maff ||||reg||9
